+  the field was written as filler, `NO_CONST` is not needed because an import
+  always binds a name, and no version byte moved. `docs/BYTECODE.md:215` and the
+  disassembler (`src/bytecode/disasm.rs`, `as <alias>`) were updated with it.
 
